[I] Python bindings for Linux SMBus access through i2c-dev

[T] python-smbus is the Python module from the i2c-tools package providing
[T] SMBus access to I2C devices through the Linux i2c-dev interface. It
[T] allows reading and writing bytes, words and blocks from Python programs.

[U] https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/utils/i2c-tools/i2c-tools.git/

